:: Lake Ruin Ivory 2
<<effects>><<wearProp "antique ivory necklace">>
You remove the necklace from your pocket. The craftsmanship is masterful, and you get the feeling that this meant a lot to someone.
<br><br>
<<if Time.isBloodMoon()>>
	You sense a presence, though it doesn't seem to interfere as you place the necklace back onto the plinth.
<<elseif $wraith.state>>
	You feel a twinge of dread as you look at your reflection in the blue gemstones. You look pale. <<stress 6>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	You decide not to linger, and place the necklace back onto the plinth.
<<else>>
	You can see your reflection in the blue gemstones. It hurts to lose such a relic but you gently place the necklace back onto the plinth.
<</if>>
<br><br>
You feel despite lingering regret, you've made a decision to mend something that was broken.
<<if Time.days gte 32>>
    <<set $wraith.state to "active">>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Lake Ruin Deep]]>><</link>>
<br>